This is another great Shadowrun game.
Pros:
+ The story is rich;
+ You have alternatives to choose, some matter while others are just cosmetic, but until you play there is no way to tell between them;
+ There are different play styles such as shaman, mage, samurai, gunner and others;
Cons:
- The overall story arch covers a buch of things, but the side quests or minor missions are like small individual games together;
- The graphics are isometric old style, I like it, but some upgrade would be nice;
- The team members have a locked inventory, it is good that we don't have to spend money on it, but we can't upgrade them too;
The game is great and worth the time and money on it.

